  "id": "presentation",
  "term": "presentation",
  "definition": "In this psychology context, presentation refers to how a person deliberately shapes what they share so others will see them in a desired way. It is a form of impression management used to communicate identity and gain social recognition, though it can also create emotional strain when the hoped-for image feels hard to maintain or open to negative judgment.",
